rendered_turn_sha256":"210b48f0d2259062f7a240533af9de2a579c676d793ea6a01b186fd76d2e8da1","session_date":"2023-06-09","session_datetime":"2023-06-09T14:31:00","session_id":"session_8","session_index":8,"source_sha256":"e8f3097ec4637a66aaae7ff79451a1d261fa0b661ba510ea4100070baefc7c42","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Hey Dave! Met with the creative team for my album yesterday. It was a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together. \n[S8T1] (dia_id: D8:1)\n\nDave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took.\n[Image caption: a photography of a pond with a boat in it surrounded by trees]\n[S8T2] (dia_id: D8:2)\n\nCalvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?\n[Image caption: a photo of a recording studio with a large window and a desk]\n[S8T3] (dia_id: D8:3)\n\nDave: Hey, nice photo of the studio! Working in a team yields incredible results, well done! Keep pushing it! I've been doing good - thanks for asking. I've been exploring some parks on the weekends to relax - it's so peaceful being surrounded by nature. Are there any chill spots you enjoy in Boston?\n[S8T4] (dia_id: D8:4)\n\nCalvin: Thanks! That studio is great for creativity. I've never been to Boston before, but I hear the parks are amazing. Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?\n[Image caption: a photo of a tree with pink flowers in the foreground]\n[S8T5] (dia_id: D8:5)\n\nDave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\n[S8T6] (dia_id: D8:6)\n\nCalvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?\n[Image caption: a photo of a path going up a hill with a view of the mountains]\n[S8T7] (dia_id: D8:7)\n\nDave: Nah, haven't gone hiking recently, but it's awesome - being in nature and pushing yourself to new heights. Clears your mind and brings a sense of calm. Have you been to the mountains before? Heard they're super chill.\n[S8T8] (dia_id: D8:8)","text_sha256":"6bc808bfa3823f4259eb8c96864382c8774305771e714ce0cd1e0511f55ee702","timestamp":"2023-06-09T14:31:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D18:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S18T1]"],"text_sha256":"30cdf0bb8c4e09d30a10a17ee2a5bb215f5785db46e3ddf13e8163ed71dcfe32"},{"dia_ids":["D18:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":16,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S18T2]"],"text_sha256":"3a5e32ce8f6c34b8c664670ea2f0b97ec7d897c869d7d68a414a33201d023bd1"},{"dia_ids":["D18:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":19,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S18T3]"],"text_sha256":"1291b7eb57928b7d5c08da993e6d29462cb8bab49c8431828a87d9e21a5810b2"},{"dia_ids":["D18:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":21,"source_locators":["[S18T4]"],"text_sha256":"f4d678f2347eae6bd93a18878dadc459e3614dbe2122d6d7fbef216e956d03ec"},{"dia_ids":["D18:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S18T5]"],"text_sha256":"68aa3fd28ec4f7b488a089950d1187e9ff83d75c8463382c34e634b38750e02d"},{"dia_ids":["D18:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S18T6]"],"text_sha256":"eec61bf10a811715771f5b08fe97eea0cb7debbb7e3d961a932489084bbc4486"}],"dia_ids":["D18:1","D18:2","D18:3"