n[S18T2] (dia_id: D18:2)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It's been a lot. Seeing everyone get behind it has been awesome. It's kinda overwhelming to think so many appreciate it. It's also cool that it's connecting with people. It really motivates me to make even better music.\n[S18T3] (dia_id: D18:3)\n\nDave: That's awesome, Calvin! It's such a great feeling when your work gets noticed and makes a positive difference. It must be really motivating for you to keep chasing your dreams.\n[S18T4] (dia_id: D18:4)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, moments like this remind me why I got into music - making a difference and sharing my own story. It's exciting to get positive feedback and it gives me strength to keep going and reach more people. My journey's just getting started!\n[S18T5] (dia_id: D18:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! You've come a long way since we started talking music. What's next for you? Anything exciting coming up?\n[S18T6] (dia_id: D18:6)","text_sha256":"a5216068958c38194f6b8c2ed9566df0be6a10eda3e79a164cbe5c20db614597","timestamp":"2023-09-13T10:56:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D28:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":14,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S28T1]"],"text_sha256":"1658b74af70a07598f8905a8fa13ff8fdcaa70cff0e96354f7cfc45649d56ed1"},{"dia_ids":["D28:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":16,"source_locators":["[S28T2]"],"text_sha256":"873d0c9b45e6c202b420b812865b173d2ec14760692535e22699f2d663e49682"},{"dia_ids":["D28:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S28T3]"],"text_sha256":"09da5fcbab997454bea494bb5f651fbdfe915eda016d6e18e4935055fe1d5ca2"},{"dia_ids":["D28:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":24,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S28T4]"],"text_sha256":"1d531ec64f80b7b42694116e5d128fae24502d0023936fbbb1aa6cdc12d798bb"},{"dia_ids":["D28:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":26,"source_locators":["[S28T5]"],"text_sha25